*** Settings ***
Force Tags    CONFIGURED    CRT    PY39    RAN_5G    RAN_5G_TDD    SBTS00
    ...    CLOUD_5G_I_BOO_AP_LOO
    ...    VARIANT_SANSA_FS_ECPRI_CMWV_FDD+TDD

Resource   ./resources/CB008533_resources.robot

Suite Setup    Run keywords    Configure VM interfaces
...            AND     Configure env  egate_setup=${egate_config}  scfc=${scfc}  ap_xml=${ap_xml}
...            AND     Setup Egate  egate_port=20000  alias=default

*** Variables ***
${egate_config}=  ${CURDIR}${/}config${/}egate_config_FRR_TDD_6Cells_SANSA_FS_4CC_CA_DSS_3UEs.cfg
${scfc}=          ${CURDIR}${/}config${/}SCFC_FDD_TDD_6cells_FS_SANSA_4CC_CA_2ABIO_DSS.xml
${ap_xml}=        ${CURDIR}${/}config${/}iphy_AEQE_AHLOA_AHFIB_6Cells_2ABIO_DSS.xml

*** Test Cases ***
CB008533-B-B2a_Multi_UE_support_for_FDD_+_FR1_TDD_4CC_DL_CA_interworking_with_DSS
    [Documentation]
    ...  *Description:*
    ...  This user scenario describes successful call setup with FDD  TDD FR1 4CC DL CA and data scheduling
    ...  for the multiple UEs. DSS is enabled in FDD PCell.
    ...
    ...  *Preconditions:*
    ...        - NRBTS/NRCELL.cellDepType is set to 1 (SA) or 10 (SA+NSA)
    ...        - NRBTS/NRDU.carrierAggregationSupportList contains elements equal to ca_Fdd_Fr1Tdd_Sa and ca_Fdd_Fdd and ca_Fdd_Any_Sa
    ...        - NRBTS/NRCELL/NRREL.sCellAdditionMethod parameter is set to 0 (blind) for each NRREL.
    ...
    ...    SCell activation method is set to buffer based:
    ...        - NRBTS.sCellActivationMethod = 1 (bufferBased)
    ...
    ...    Initial number of SCells to be activated jointly is set:
    ...        - MRBTS/NRBTS/NRCELL.iniNumSCellsToActivate = 2
    ...
    ...    DRX is disabled in both FDD and TDD FR1 cells:
    ...        - NRBTS/NRCELL.actCDrx = false
    ...
    ...    Aperiodic CSI reporting for PCell only is enabled:
    ...        - NRBTS.NRCELL.actAperCsi = true
    ...
    ...    TDD cells are configured with beamforming:
    ...        - NRBTS/NRCELL.actBeamforming = true
    ...
    ...    Beam Refinement is activated on TDD cell:
    ...        - NRBTS/NRCELL.nrBtsBeamRefinementP2 = true
    ...
    ...    TDD cells are configured without 5GC002200:
    ...        - NRBTS/NRCELL.dlMimoMode <> 70 (8x4 Closed Loop Spatial Multiplexing)
    ...
    ...    FDM scheduling is enabled:
    ...        - NRBTS.actFdmScheduling = true
    ...        - NRBTS/NRCELL.actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot = true
    ...
    ...    ·    PCell has less than NRCELL-maxNumOfUsersNRCell connected UEs
    ...    ·    PCell has less than NRCELL-maxNumOfCaUsersNRCell connected UEs with FR1 CA configured
    ...    ·    SCells have less than NRCELL-maxNumOfUsersNRCell connected UEs each
    ...    ·    SCells have less than NRCELL-maxNumOfSCellAlloc DL SCell allocations each
    ...    ·    SCell weights (NRBTS/NRCELL.weightForSCellSelection) are configured as below:
    ...
    ...    Cell 5 (TDD) > Cell 1 (FDD) > Cell 2 (TDD) > Cell 3 (FDD)
    ...
    ...    UEs support Inter-band 4CC band combinations:
    ...        - CA_n25A-n41(2A)-n71A (FDD + TDD + TDD + FDD)
    ...        - CA_n25A-n41C-n71A (FDD + TDD + TDD + FDD)
    ...        - CA_n41(2A)-n66A-n71A (TDD + TDD + FDD + FDD)
    ...        - CA_n41C-n66A-n71A (TDD + TDD + FDD + FDD)
    ...        - CA_n25A-n41A-n66A-n71A (FDD + TDD + FDD + FDD)
    ...
    ...    The same as US CB008533-A#B5 (Single UE FDD + FR1 TDD 4CC DL CA interworking with DSS).
    ...
    ...    The DSS is enabled in FDD PCell and in both FDD SCells:
    ...        - NRBTS.actLteNrDss = true
    ...        - NIDD parameter lteNrDssMode is set to DSS phase 3: DSS_Phase_3
    ...
    ...    PDSCH traffic at SSB and TRS slots with CSI-RS rate matching in DSS is enabled:
    ...        - NRCELL.actPdschRmCsirsForTracking = true
    ...        - NRCELL.actPdschAtSsbSlots = true
    ...
    ...    NR DSS with Improved Allocation Range (5GC001745-C) is enabled:
    ...        - DSSNR.lteNrDssDlRatio.maxNrDssRatio=100
    ...        - DSSNR.lteNrDssDlRatio.minNrDssRatio=5
    ...        - DSSNR.maxLteDssSibRb = 48
    ...        - LNCEL.dlsDciCch = 'DCI format 1A'
    ...        - LNCEL.dlsUsePartPrb = 'PRBs with PSS or SSS and PBCH used'
    ...
    ...    Super fast allocation (CB007738-A) is enabled:
    ...        - LNCEL.DSSNR.actLteNrDssFastAlloc = true
    ...        - NRCELL.NRDSSLTE.actLteNrDssFastAlloc = true
    ...
    ...    PRB blanking is activated in FDD PCell, 6 PRBs at the low edge of the FDD carrier is blanked in both DL and UL:
    ...        - NRCELL.actPRBBlanking = true
    ...        - NRCELL.nbrOfBlankedPRBsLowEdgeDL = 6
    ...        - NRCELL.nbrOfBlankedPRBsLowEdgeUL = 6
    ...        - NRCELL.nbrOfBlankedPRBsHighEdgeDL = 0
    ...        - NRCELL.nbrOfBlankedPRBsHighEdgeUL = 0
    ...
    ...    CB008533 feature is activated:
    ...        - NRBTS/NRCELL.maxNumSCellsDlFr1 = 3
    ...
    ...    FDD and TDD FR1 cells are configured and on-air
    ...
    ...    Several UEs are able to attach to NR FDD PCell
    ...
    ...    LTE site of DSS is simulated on Airphone.
    ...
    ...  *Test Steps:*
    ...   Step 0.1    3 4CC capable NR-UEs are registered to PCell ( Cell-3 )
    ...   Step 0.2    PDU session is setup for NR-UEs to trigger SCell Addition.
    ...   Step 0.3    350 mbps of DL traffic is started on every NR-UEs.
    ...   Step 1.1    Set resource allocation high/medium/small on SCells
    ...   Step 1.2    Wait for CRM to adjust DL slots
    ...   Step 1.3    Verify traffic rates
    ...   Step 1.4    Verify M55332C00001 and M55332C02001 PMCounters
    ...   Step 2.1    Set resource allocation small/high/medium on SCells
    ...   Step 2.2    Wait for CRM to adjust DL slots
    ...   Step 2.3    Verify traffic rates
    ...   Step 2.4    Verify M55332C00001 and M55332C02001 PMCounters
    ...   Step 3.1    Set resource allocation medium/small/high on SCells
    ...   Step 3.2    Wait for CRM to adjust DL slots
    ...   Step 3.3    Verify traffic rates
    ...   Step 3.4    Verify M55332C00001 and M55332C02001 PMCounters
    ...   Step 4    Deregister NR-UEs
    ...
    ...  *Postconditions:*
    ...    UE is configured with one FDD FR1 cell(F1) as PCell and 1 FDD and 2 TDD cells as SCells
    ...    The scheduling of CSI-RS for Channel acquisition will start in the SCell for the CA UE only after
    ...    the MAC SCell activation process is completed successfully.
    ...    UE is configured to perform CSI Measurements and reports CQI measurements via PUCCH on the PCell for all carriers:
    ...    gNB is ready to accept from UE periodic CQI measurements reports of PCell via dedicated PUCCH Format3 resource on PCell.
    ...    gNB is ready to accept from UE periodic CQI measurements reports of each SCell via dedicated PUCCH Format3 resource on PCell.
    ...
    ...  *References:*
    ...    [1] CFAM for CB008533 - https://gates.nsn-net.net/view/00025e8a#o=0
    ...
    ...  *History:*
    ...    v0.1 2022.03.21 Marcin Gorczyca - test case draft

    Setup DSS

    Log to console    "Step 0: Start Traffic"

    Set pdu param for internal traffic  UE_ID=1
    Set pdu param for internal traffic  UE_ID=2
    Set pdu param for internal traffic  UE_ID=3

    Register UE  UE_ID=1  CELL_ID=3
    Register UE  UE_ID=2  CELL_ID=3
    Register UE  UE_ID=3  CELL_ID=3

    Establish PDU session  UE_ID=1    timeout=20
    Establish PDU session  UE_ID=2    timeout=20
    Establish PDU session  UE_ID=3    timeout=20

    Start SA traffic  ue=1  dir=dl  traffic_rate=350Mbps
    Start SA traffic  ue=2  dir=dl  traffic_rate=350Mbps
    Start SA traffic  ue=3  dir=dl  traffic_rate=350Mbps

    Log to console    "Step 1: Check Resource allocation with high/medium/small allocation"

    Setup on egate high allocation on enb1 cell1 gnb2 cell3
    Setup on egate medium allocation on enb1 cell2 gnb2 cell5
    Setup on egate small allocation on enb1 cell3 gnb2 cell6

    Wait 60s for throughput stable
    Wait for next full PM Interval

    Verify counters for high/medium/small allocation
    Verify traffic rates are correct for Step 1

    Log to console    "Step 2: Check Resource allocation with small/high/medium allocation"

    Setup on egate small allocation on enb1 cell1 gnb2 cell3
    Setup on egate high allocation on enb1 cell2 gnb2 cell5
    Setup on egate medium allocation on enb1 cell3 gnb2 cell6

    Wait 60s for throughput stable
    Verify counters for small/high/medium allocation
    Verify traffic rates are correct for Step 2

    Log to console     "Step 3: Check Resource allocation with medium/small/high allocation"

    Setup on egate medium allocation on enb1 cell1 gnb2 cell3
    Setup on egate small allocation on enb1 cell2 gnb2 cell5
    Setup on egate high allocation on enb1 cell3 gnb2 cell6

    Wait 60s for throughput stable
    Verify counters for medium/small/high allocation
    Verify traffic rates are correct for Step 3

    Report DSS counters to RP

    [Teardown]      Run keywords    Stop SA traffic  ue=1             AND
                    ...             Release PDU session   UE_ID=1     AND
                    ...             Deregister UE  UE_ID=1            AND
                    ...             Stop SA traffic  ue=2             AND
                    ...             Release PDU session   UE_ID=2     AND
                    ...             Deregister UE  UE_ID=2            AND
                    ...             Stop SA traffic  ue=3             AND
                    ...             Release PDU session   UE_ID=3     AND
                    ...             Deregister UE  UE_ID=3
